# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:3
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_63ee727d:

    # "From the depths of the cavern, the sound of drums... Drums beating in the depths of the darkness."
    "Das profundezas da caverna, o som de tambores... Tambores batendo nas profundezas da escuridão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:9
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_dcd0cb47:

    # MARKUS "What is that?"
    MARKUS "O que é isso?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:10
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_96b7d8a2:

    # MC "...Come on, let's get closer."
    MC "...Vamos, vamos nos aproximar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:14
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_bc88f2af:

    # MARKUS "...F-Fuck?! Are you not hearing the same thing as me?"
    MARKUS "...M-Merda?! Você não está ouvindo a mesma coisa que eu?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:15
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_567a8d97:

    # MC "Shh! Just follow me damn it!"
    MC "Shh! Apenas me siga, droga!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:16
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_160d87e9:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i} ...Fuck!"
    MARKUS "{i}*Suspiro*{/i} ...Merda!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:19
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_d30fcc76:

    # "Following the sounds, we decided it was best to avoid the main pathway where the others would have walked, and instead clambered our way through one of the other connecting winding passages."
    "Seguindo os sons, decidimos que era melhor evitar o caminho principal onde os outros teriam andado, e em vez disso subimos por uma das outras passagens sinuosas de conexão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:20
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_3c7a1c5e:

    # "The less traversed pathway rose up as we continued to walk along it, till finally, we stumbled upon an opening which we cautiously approached."
    "O caminho menos percorrido se elevou enquanto continuávamos a andar por ele, até que finalmente, tropeçamos em uma abertura que nos aproximamos cautelosamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:24
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f103c1d0:

    # "Peering through the opening cautiously, we could see we were high above the many thousands of Demorai down below in the great Cavern like hall."
    "Espiando pela abertura cautelosamente, podíamos ver que estávamos bem acima dos muitos milhares de Demorai lá embaixo no grande salão como uma Caverna."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:25
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_907217ef:

    # "Organized into neat rows, the Demorai forces gathered and waited patiently, staring down at some great oval stone stage with strange markings on it and lit burning iron fire pits all around."
    "Organizados em fileiras organizadas, as forças Demorai se reuniram e esperaram pacientemente, olhando para algum grande palco de pedra oval com marcas estranhas e fogueiras de ferro acesas ao redor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:26
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_907b832d:

    # "The front row beat their drums in a synchronized steady rhythm, each boom echoing deeply through the ruins."
    "A fileira da frente batia seus tambores em um ritmo constante e sincronizado, cada estrondo ecoando profundamente pelas ruínas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:27
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_4174dccb:

    # "Markus and I shared a brief look of bewilderment as we continued to watch the scene unfold below us."
    "Markus e eu compartilhamos um breve olhar de perplexidade enquanto continuávamos a assistir a cena se desenrolar abaixo de nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:28
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_64e08ffa:

    # "Down below, one group of the Demorai stood away from the rest, many of them robed and distinctly on the fringes."
    "Lá embaixo, um grupo de Demorai estava afastado do resto, muitos deles encapuzados e distintamente nas margens."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:29
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_30771f5e:

    # "Amongst them though, an old, hunched woman with ashen skin, and beside her, perhaps the most strangely ethereally beautiful, and yet, oddly baleful woman I had ever laid my eyes on, who watched the whole affair with arms crossed looking sternly ahead towards the stage."
    "Entre eles, porém, uma velha corcunda com pele cinzenta, e ao lado dela, talvez a mulher mais estranhamente etereamente bela, e ainda assim, estranhamente sinistra que eu já tinha posto meus olhos, que assistia a toda a cena de braços cruzados olhando severamente para o palco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:30
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_84b9de98:

    # "Finally, the drum beats abruptly stopped as a robed figure emerged onto the stage."
    "Finalmente, as batidas do tambor pararam abruptamente quando uma figura encapuzada emergiu no palco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:37
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_0e766aec:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "{i}...How long since we last stood in these hallowed halls?{/i}"
    DARK_EMPEROR "{i}...Há quanto tempo desde a última vez que estivemos nestes salões sagrados?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:38
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_29ff24ea:

    # "Me and Markus shared another look towards each other."
    "Markus e eu compartilhamos outro olhar um para o outro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:39
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_96d7be6e:

    # MC "({i}It speaks... A fucking Demorai speaks!{/i})"
    MC "({i}Ele fala... Um maldito Demorai fala!{/i})"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:40
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_44d8ced1:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "How long since our great dream began and led us to this most sacred war?"
    DARK_EMPEROR "Há quanto tempo desde que nosso grande sonho começou e nos conduziu a esta guerra tão sagrada?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:41
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_bad90604:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "The sacrifices our people have shouldered to bring us this far have been immeasurable."
    DARK_EMPEROR "Os sacrifícios que nosso povo suportou para nos trazer até aqui foram imensuráveis."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:42
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_aaa2fb79:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "From the bloody battle rivers of Ashara to the black mines of Helenos, we have fought, and we have prevailed."
    DARK_EMPEROR "Dos rios sangrentos de batalha de Ashara às minas negras de Helenos, nós lutamos e prevalecemos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:43
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_80466b4e:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "Now your Emperor calls upon you once again..."
    DARK_EMPEROR "Agora seu Imperador vos convoca mais uma vez..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:44
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_b285ac6b:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "It is no secret this war has taken longer than any of us first expected."
    DARK_EMPEROR "Não é segredo que esta guerra durou mais do que qualquer um de nós esperava inicialmente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:45
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_e3fbe0ab:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "Our mistakes early on cost us dearly... But now, the time has come to end this endless stalemate!"
    DARK_EMPEROR "Nossos erros iniciais nos custaram caro... Mas agora, chegou a hora de acabar com esse impasse interminável!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:46
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_dcd1cbc5:

    # "The mass of Demorai roared in excitement."
    "A massa de Demorai rugiu de excitação."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:47
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_eafb5cde:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "Malakai blesses us with Lord Zanarak's return from his great crusade, and with his aid, I pledge to you."
    DARK_EMPEROR "Malakai nos abençoa com o retorno do Senhor Zanarak de sua grande cruzada, e com sua ajuda, eu vos prometo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:48
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_c715dea1:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "WE SHALL CAST OUT THOSE WHO STAND IN OUR WAY AND SWEEP AWAY THEIR ARMIES LIKE DUST!"
    DARK_EMPEROR "NÓS EXPULSAREMOS AQUELES QUE FICAREM EM NOSSO CAMINHO E VARREREMOS SEUS EXÉRCITOS COMO POEIRA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:49
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_cdfa84e5:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "THE LAND SHALL FLOW RED WITH THEIR BLOOD TILL THEY ARE BUT A FORGOTTEN DREAM WE ONE DAY TELL OUR YOUNG!"
    DARK_EMPEROR "A TERRA FLUIRÁ VERMELHA COM SEU SANGUE ATÉ QUE SEJAM APENAS UM SONHO ESQUECIDO QUE UM DIA CONTAREMOS AOS NOSSOS JOVENS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:50
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_376b76ab:

    # "The Demorai horde had now been worked up into a roaring frenzy."
    "A horda Demorai agora tinha sido agitada em um frenesi rugidor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:51
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_1c6020c2:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "Do you hear it my children?"
    DARK_EMPEROR "Vocês ouvem isso, meus filhos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:52
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_9f278520:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "The drums of war beat once again... Our great plan is finally set in motion!"
    DARK_EMPEROR "Os tambores da guerra batem mais uma vez... Nosso grande plano está finalmente em andamento!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:53
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_572abbfa:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "Our Empire stands on the edge of victory! Will you shed your blood with me one final time till the sweet night sings our people songs once again?"
    DARK_EMPEROR "Nosso Império está à beira da vitória! Você derramará seu sangue comigo uma última vez até que a doce noite cante canções do nosso povo mais uma vez?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:54
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_6abc444e:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "WILL YOU?!"
    DARK_EMPEROR "VOCÊ ACEITA?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:56
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_48164ee7:

    # "The Demorai beat at the drums wildly as the Demorai crowds now roared so loud it was almost painful to the ears."
    "Os Demorai batiam nos tambores selvagemente enquanto as multidões Demorai agora rugiam tão alto que era quase doloroso para os ouvidos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:57
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_3d00b271:

    # "The dark emperor rose up his arms into the air as he cried out."
    "O imperador negro ergueu seus braços no ar enquanto gritava."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:58
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_09cd027b:

    # DARK_EMPEROR "LET THE CELEBRATIONS BEGIN!"
    DARK_EMPEROR "QUE COMEÇEM AS CELEBRAÇÕES!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:61
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_44a1e136:

    # "The Demorai roared out in thunderous cries of jubilation, huge trays of beautifully cooked food were brought and shared amongst them."
    "Os Demorai rugiram em gritos estrondosos de júbilo, enormes bandejas de comida lindamente cozida foram trazidas e compartilhadas entre eles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:62
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_24bc9b33:

    # "The drum beat now became faster and other instruments tuned in."
    "A batida do tambor agora ficava mais rápida e outros instrumentos se juntavam."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:63
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_72e6dbb6:

    # "It was perhaps the most bizarre thing I ever witnessed, the Demorai, the unspeakable terrors thought as nothing more than savage beasts... jovial and dancing with glee."
    "Foi talvez a coisa mais bizarra que eu já testemunhei, os Demorai, os terrores indescritíveis considerados nada mais que bestas selvagens... joviais e dançando de alegria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:64
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_08557dd6:

    # "In the corner as they danced still, that same stern ethereal woman stood unfazed, arms folded as she watched the scene unfold before her."
    "No canto enquanto eles dançavam ainda, aquela mesma mulher etérea severa estava imperturbável, braços cruzados enquanto observava a cena se desenrolar diante dela."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:65
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_62acc847:

    # "I could barely pull my eyes away from her beauty till I found Markus' claw on my shoulder as he leaned over to whisper to me."
    "Eu mal conseguia desviar meus olhos de sua beleza até que encontrei a garra de Markus no meu ombro enquanto ele se inclinava para sussurrar para mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:66
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_758541a6:

    # MARKUS "We should leave."
    MARKUS "Devíamos ir embora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:67
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_7398bf84:

    # "I nodded, and the two of us crawled our way backwards away from the strange party and made our way back the way we came."
    "Eu assenti, e nós dois rastejamos para trás para longe da festa estranha e fizemos nosso caminho de volta por onde viemos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:71
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_7d97d050:

    # UNKNOWN "...I see we continue to dance on the edge of oblivion."
    UNKNOWN "...Vejo que continuamos a dançar à beira do esquecimento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:73
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_d3f17625:

    # UNKNOWN "{i}...I trust you saw them?{/i}"
    UNKNOWN "{i}...Confio que os viste?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:75
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_b548957e:

    # UNKNOWN "Of course."
    UNKNOWN "Claro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:76
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_556a9aef:

    # UNKNOWN "{i}Then you know what to do, girl.{/i}"
    UNKNOWN "{i}Então sabe o que fazer, garota.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:78
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_c790737a:

    # UNKNOWN "Of course, High Mother."
    UNKNOWN "Claro, Alta Mãe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:81
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_85f74344:

    # "As we made our way hastily back, the jovial sounds of the party became more and more distant behind us."
    "Enquanto voltávamos apressadamente, os sons joviais da festa ficavam cada vez mais distantes atrás de nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:82
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_cbc2033f:

    # MARKUS "Fucking hells... Now there's {i}two{/i} Emperors?"
    MARKUS "Raios me partam... Agora há {i}dois{/i} Imperadores?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:83
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f6a04ec0:

    # MARKUS "One was enough!"
    MARKUS "Uma foi suficiente!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:84
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_a39f2156:

    # MARKUS "We need to tell the others what we've seen."
    MARKUS "Precisamos contar aos outros o que vimos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:86
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_8a11ccd4:

    # MARKUS "The Demorai... They-"
    MARKUS "Os Demorai... Eles-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:87
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_e15d6484:

    # UNKNOWN "{i}Talk?{/i}"
    UNKNOWN "{i}Falar?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:100
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f5b08b87:

    # "The two of us spun around, claws ready as we stared down at the same ethereal beauty I had seen earlier."
    "Nós dois giramos, garras prontas enquanto encarávamos a mesma beleza etérea que eu tinha visto antes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:101
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_06ae9a6c:

    # MC "How did you-"
    MC "Como você-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:102
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_8a42a2c0:

    # UNKNOWN "Please... You make pitiful spies."
    UNKNOWN "Por favor... Vocês são espiões patéticos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:103
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_25cde490:

    # MC "What do you want, Demorai?"
    MC "O que você quer, Demorai?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:104
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_537bfc02:

    # "The girl laughed."
    "A garota riu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:105
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_eb3d71ec:

    # UNKNOWN "My name is Sypha... Sypha of House Lamont."
    UNKNOWN "Meu nome é Sypha... Sypha da Casa Lamont."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:106
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_28fc5efd:

    # MC "House... {i}Lamont?{/i}"
    MC "Casa... {i}Lamont?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:107
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_4ab09aa4:

    # "The Demorai known as Sypha pointed first towards me."
    "A Demorai conhecida como Sypha apontou primeiro para mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:108
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_6402b508:

    # SYPHA @ laugh "And you are [player_name!t]."
    SYPHA @ laugh "E você é [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:109
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_8a002215:

    # "Then, she pointed towards Markus."
    "Então, ela apontou para Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:111
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_ea5290d0:

    # SYPHA @ laugh "And you are Markus."
    SYPHA @ laugh "E você é Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:112
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_5b597001:

    # MC "You... Know who we are?"
    MC "Você... Sabe quem somos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:113
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f10011c4:

    # SYPHA @ smug "{i}I know many things.{/i}"
    SYPHA @ smug "{i}Eu sei muitas coisas.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:114
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_49fb5000:

    # "The two of us nervously glanced towards each other, how was our secrecy so easily exposed?"
    "Nós dois nos entreolhamos nervosamente, como foi que nosso segredo foi tão facilmente exposto?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:115
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_39d14c74:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Now, you should come with me if you want to make it out of this place alive."
    SYPHA @ talk "Agora, vocês devem vir comigo se quiserem sair deste lugar vivos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:117
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_89f19a5d:

    # MARKUS "No chance, Demorai."
    MARKUS "Sem chance, Demorai."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:118
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_ff6edd96:

    # "Markus readied himself for battle."
    "Markus se preparou para a batalha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:119
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_8a368e42:

    # SYPHA @ angry "There are hordes of guards now stationed outside the entrance which you came in through."
    SYPHA @ angry "Há hordas de guardas agora estacionados do lado de fora da entrada pela qual você entrou."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:120
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_c4a8b650:

    # "Sypha shrugged."
    "Sypha deu de ombros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:121
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_be59f236:

    # SYPHA @ think "Perhaps you will be able to fight your way through them all, perhaps not."
    SYPHA @ think "Talvez você consiga lutar contra todos eles, talvez não."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:122
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_be3ae20d:

    # SYPHA @ talk "But if you follow me, I can lead you out safely."
    SYPHA @ talk "Mas se você me seguir, posso levá-lo para fora em segurança."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:123
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_9c56adeb:

    # MC "Why in all of the hells would we trust you?"
    MC "Por que em todos os infernos confiaríamos em você?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:124
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_fe829bce:

    # "Sypha smiled."
    "Sypha sorriu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:125
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_084492fa:

    # SYPHA @ smug "...You really don't have any idea about what's {i}really{/i} going on, do you?"
    SYPHA @ smug "...Você realmente não tem ideia do que está {i}realmente{/i} acontecendo, não é?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:126
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_ca8c137f:

    # "Once again me and Markus shared another glance at each other, unsure of how to proceed."
    "Mais uma vez Markus e eu compartilhamos outro olhar um para o outro, incertos de como proceder."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:127
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_10486110:

    # SYPHA @ happy "Let us just say that I am a friend."
    SYPHA @ happy "Digamos apenas que sou uma amiga."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:128
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_e3aab580:

    # SYPHA @ think "And the situation you two have found yourself in is vastly more complicated than you could ever imagine."
    SYPHA @ think "E a situação em que vocês dois se encontram é muito mais complicada do que poderiam imaginar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:129
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_221a3ffd:

    # "Behind us, we heard the sounds of footsteps drawing ever closer."
    "Atrás de nós, ouvimos os sons de passos se aproximando cada vez mais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:130
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_3679e5dc:

    # SYPHA @ talk "I imagine all that fighting while you're both stuck in that tunnel will only draw the attention of more Demorai though."
    SYPHA @ talk "No entanto, imagino que toda essa luta enquanto vocês dois estão presos naquele túnel só vai atrair a atenção de mais Demorai."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:131
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_06bf9efc:

    # SYPHA @ angry "Won't be very pleasant... Squeezed in shoulder to shoulder like that, desperately trying to fight your way out."
    SYPHA @ angry "Não vai ser muito agradável... Espremidos ombro a ombro assim, tentando desesperadamente abrir caminho lutando."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:132
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_739f3509:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Probably turn into a real bloodbath."
    SYPHA @ talk "Provavelmente vai virar um verdadeiro banho de sangue."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:133
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_e97731b7:

    # "The sound of footsteps continued to grow louder as me and Markus remained frozen in indecision, my heart racing."
    "O som de passos continuou a ficar mais alto enquanto Markus e eu permanecíamos congelados em indecisão, meu coração acelerado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:134
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_d8783583:

    # SYPHA @ angry "Mmm, sounds like times running out... Make your choice."
    SYPHA @ angry "Mmm, parece que o tempo está acabando... Faça sua escolha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:135
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_468880d2:

    # MARKUS "It's a trick [player_name!t]! She's just trying to lead us astray!"
    MARKUS "É um truque [player_name!t]! Ela está apenas tentando nos desviar do caminho!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:136
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_4eea648d:

    # MARKUS "She'll walk us right into a fucking trap!"
    MARKUS "Ela vai nos levar direto para uma armadilha do caralho!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:137
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f1f49466:

    # MC "(Fuck... What should I do?)"
    MC "(Porra... O que devo fazer?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:140
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_78aa8a05:

    # "Markus stared at me, jaw hung open in shock as Sypha smiled."
    "Markus olhou para mim, de queixo caído em choque enquanto Sypha sorria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:143
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_65cbaabd:

    # MARKUS "You... You can't be serious!"
    MARKUS "Você... Você não pode estar falando sério!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:144
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_603b4759:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]! She's a fucking Demorai!"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]! Ela é uma maldita Demorai!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:145
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_37812168:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Follow me, quickly!"
    SYPHA @ talk "Siga-me, rápido!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:150
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_e70bac09:

    # "As I followed after Sypha, Markus very reluctantly followed behind, still voicing his displeasure at what a terrible idea this was."
    "Enquanto eu seguia Sypha, Markus muito relutantemente seguiu atrás, ainda expressando seu descontentamento sobre que ideia terrível isso era."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:151
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_2c0611f4:

    # "Sypha continued to lead us down another winding path, and as we followed after her, the sounds of footsteps behind us grew quieter and quieter."
    "Sypha continuou a nos levar por outro caminho sinuoso, e enquanto a seguíamos, os sons de passos atrás de nós ficavam cada vez mais quietos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:152
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_525807a3:

    # "There was an eerie echo throughout the strange cave like tunnels as we followed her through, and for a moment, I thought perhaps this might have been a mistake."
    "Havia um eco sinistro pelos estranhos túneis como cavernas enquanto a seguíamos, e por um momento, pensei que talvez isso pudesse ter sido um erro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:153
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_461e2beb:

    # "Who knows where she was really taking us?"
    "Quem sabe para onde ela estava realmente nos levando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:154
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_02f2b9ae:

    # "In my haste, I agreed to follow her, but why?"
    "Na minha pressa, concordei em segui-la, mas por que?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:155
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_c94f965e:

    # "I had no reason to trust her, in fact, I have every reason {i}not{/i} to trust her."
    "Eu não tinha razão para confiar nela, na verdade, tenho todas as razões {i}para não{/i} confiar nela."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:156
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_eeed5d51:

    # "And yet, I followed her all the same into the strange depths of this dark abyss world."
    "E ainda assim, eu a segui mesmo assim para as profundezas estranhas deste mundo de abismo escuro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:157
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_8eca7023:

    # MC "...Why are you helping us?"
    MC "...Por que você está nos ajudando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:158
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_eb84e11c:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Everything will be made clear in time."
    SYPHA @ talk "Tudo ficará claro com o tempo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:159
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_e84e894c:

    # SYPHA @ talk "I don't have time to explain everything now."
    SYPHA @ talk "Não tenho tempo para explicar tudo agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:160
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_6ceb12d8:

    # MARKUS "Well what the fuck is this place even?"
    MARKUS "Bem, que porra é esse lugar, afinal?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:161
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f3145e93:

    # SYPHA "..."
    SYPHA "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:162
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_4f1eb2e7:

    # "Sypha didn't answer, she cast a glance over her shoulder to make sure we were still following."
    "Sypha não respondeu, ela lançou um olhar sobre o ombro para ter certeza de que ainda estávamos seguindo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:163
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_0b65b231:

    # "Deeper and deeper through the winding paths we tread, till finally, an opening up ahead."
    "Mais e mais fundo pelos caminhos sinuosos nós trilhamos, até que finalmente, uma abertura à frente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:173
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_5efbad91:

    # "Leading us out into the open desert, Sypha pointed off into the distance."
    "Nos levando para o deserto aberto, Sypha apontou para longe na distância."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:174
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_885a7f1b:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Novaras is that way."
    SYPHA @ talk "Novaras fica naquela direção."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:175
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_74552aff:

    # "Both me and Markus cautiously looked around, half-expecting an ambush from Demorai amidst the dunes."
    "Tanto Markus quanto eu olhamos cautelosamente ao redor, meio esperando uma emboscada dos Demorai entre as dunas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:176
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_0937ddc8:

    # SYPHA @ talk "...There's no one coming."
    SYPHA @ talk "...Não vem ninguém."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:177
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f87d57bf:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Now go."
    SYPHA @ talk "Agora vá."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:178
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_d0e13cc4:

    # MC "Hold on a second."
    MC "Espere um segundo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:179
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f52b8245:

    # MC "Who are you really?"
    MC "Quem é você realmente?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:180
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_078c8000:

    # SYPHA @ happy "I am friend, we share a common goal."
    SYPHA @ happy "Sou amigo, compartilhamos um objetivo comum."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:181
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_d7c8fa1b:

    # MC @ talk "What goal is that?"
    MC @ talk "Que objetivo é esse?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:182
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_47374a90:

    # SYPHA @ happy "{i}To end this war, of course.{/i}"
    SYPHA @ happy "{i}Para acabar com esta guerra, claro.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:183
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_6e508b48:

    # MARKUS "With your side winning, right?"
    MARKUS "Com o seu lado vencendo, certo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:184
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_bf2e3a2d:

    # SYPHA @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    SYPHA @ talk "{i}*Suspiro*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:185
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_05779f1e:

    # SYPHA @ angry "There is more at stake here than either of you could possibly imagine."
    SYPHA @ angry "Há mais em jogo aqui do que qualquer um de vocês pode imaginar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:186
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_978ed19d:

    # SYPHA @ happy "All you need to know for now is I'm a friend and I will send one of my agents to make contact soon."
    SYPHA @ happy "Tudo que vocês precisam saber por enquanto é que sou um amigo e enviarei um dos meus agentes para fazer contato em breve."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:187
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_f4b31c5c:

    # MC @ talk "Your... {i}agents?{/i}"
    MC @ talk "Seus... {i}agentes?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:188
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_56d0a348:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Don't worry..."
    SYPHA @ talk "Não se preocupe..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:189
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_9fda55a7:

    # SYPHA @ happy "She's been dying to meet you again."
    SYPHA @ happy "Ela está morrendo de vontade de te encontrar de novo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:190
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_6ce10212:

    # MC "{i}Again?{/i}"
    MC "{i}De novo?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:191
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_7a66902c:

    # SYPHA @ talk "Go now... Both of you."
    SYPHA @ talk "Vão agora... Vocês dois."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:192
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_947804e9:

    # "Me and Markus shared another still bewildered look as we turned to leave."
    "Markus e eu compartilhamos outro olhar ainda perplexo enquanto nos virávamos para sair."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:194
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_b0f0794f:

    # "As we did so, Sypha called back to me once more."
    "Enquanto fazíamos isso, Sypha me chamou mais uma vez."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:195
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_2c0ed6fd:

    # SYPHA @ happy "Oh, [player_name!t]."
    SYPHA @ happy "Ah, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:196
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_d19e2aea:

    # SYPHA @ happy "That reminds me..."
    SYPHA @ happy "Isso me lembra..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:197
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_a9501b8c:

    # SYPHA @ perv "{i}I look forward to claiming you!{/i}"
    SYPHA @ perv "{i}Estou ansioso para reivindicar você!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:198
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_ecfc2d4f:

    # "As I pondered Sypha's words, Markus' hand grabbed me by the shoulder and pulled me away."
    "Enquanto eu ponderava as palavras de Sypha, a mão de Markus me agarrou pelo ombro e me puxou para longe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:201
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_031db3f7:

    # MARKUS "Come on... Forget the witch."
    MARKUS "Vamos lá... Esqueça a bruxa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:203
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_4a50fc82:

    # MARKUS "Let's get out of here."
    MARKUS "Vamos sair daqui."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:205
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_bf2e3a2d_1:

    # SYPHA @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    SYPHA @ talk "{i}*Suspiro*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:207
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_3ab2961d:

    # SYPHA @ disgust "Have it your way, morons."
    SYPHA @ disgust "Que seja do seu jeito, idiotas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:208
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_7e33e725:

    # "The sounds of footsteps drew closer and closer as Sypha continued to look at us with pure disappointment."
    "Os sons de passos se aproximavam cada vez mais enquanto Sypha continuava a nos olhar com pura decepção."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:210
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_ee686999:

    # "We hurried past her, heading back the way we came as quickly as we could before we were confronted by dozens of Demorai."
    "Passamos correndo por ela, voltando pelo caminho de onde viemos o mais rápido que podíamos antes de sermos confrontados por dezenas de Demorai."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:215
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_70c244f5:

    # MARKUS "FUCK!"
    MARKUS "PORRA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:230
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_329b850a:

    # BLACK "More on their way."
    BLACK "Mais a caminho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:231
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_5e2597f0:

    # MC "Bring it on, demon spawn!"
    MC "Manda ver, cria do demônio!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:232
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_16fbf62c:

    # BLACK "Bringing it on."
    BLACK "Mandando ver."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:233
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_26787827:

    # MC "(That's not what I~)"
    MC "(Não foi isso que eu~)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:234
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_923941b2:

    # BLACK "Focus."
    BLACK "Foco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:244
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_1ccdb9ed:

    # "The dozens of bloodied, torn to shreds Demorai bodies littered the tunnel and piled up so high we had to clamber over the piles of their torn limbs to reach the outside."
    "Dezenas de corpos de Demorai ensanguentados e despedaçados cobriam o túnel e se amontoavam tão alto que tivemos que escalar as pilhas de seus membros dilacerados para chegar ao exterior."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:245
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_1975b4a8:

    # "Behind us, Sypha stood watching the whole thing."
    "Atrás de nós, Sypha ficou observando a coisa toda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:246
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_b61029f4:

    # SYPHA @ talk "{i}...Fucking idiots.{/i}"
    SYPHA @ talk "{i}...Idiotas do caralho.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:248
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_42c67f47:

    # "We didn't want to waste anymore time, we could hear the sound of new stomping feet hurrying their way towards us, and quickly, we sprung our escape."
    "Não queríamos perder mais tempo, podíamos ouvir o som de novos pés pisoteando correndo em nossa direção, e rapidamente, saltamos para nossa fuga."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:249
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_fef66eab:

    # "We made our way back to Novaras as quickly as we could."
    "Voltamos para Novaras o mais rápido que pudemos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:250
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_000e2fa3:

    # "What we had seen left both of us shaken, our whole worlds as we understood it, collapsing around us."
    "O que tínhamos visto nos deixou ambos abalados, nossos mundos inteiros como os entendíamos, desmoronando ao nosso redor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:251
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_496cf17b:

    # "Near by the gates of Novaras, we changed back into our human forms and picked up our clothes from where we left them."
    "Perto dos portões de Novaras, voltamos às nossas formas humanas e pegamos nossas roupas de onde as deixamos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:252
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_2_56d8eadb:

    # "In silence, we made our way back to the Gate."
    "Em silêncio, voltamos para o Portão."

